{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1472632-god-of-jade-pillars","id":1472632,"title":"God of Jade Pillars?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-01-17T17:48:10-08:00","id":1472632,"title":"God of Jade Pillars?","content":"Given how everything has a god in the Exalted setting, do you think that there is an overgod of the Jade Pillars that the Exalted used to push back the Wyld? This is primarily a 2E question as that is what I am most familiar with, though any insights to how this might work for 3E will be most welcome. Also, how would Jade Pillars even work in the West when everything is water at the edge of Creation? Magitech flotation devices?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-18T17:51:55-08:00","id":1500683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1472632-god-of-jade-pillars#post1472632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given how everything has a god in the Exalted setting, do you think that there is an overgod of the Jade Pillars that the Exalted used to push back the Wyld? This is primarily a 2E question as that is what I am most familiar with, though any insights to how this might work for 3E will be most welcome. Also, how would Jade Pillars even work in the West when everything is water at the edge of Creation? Magitech flotation devices?</div> </div> </div> </div>Black Jade pillars, they ressonate with water essence, therefore they float.<br /> <br /> Or their mere existence in a place defines it as water instead of chaos, making a fleeting but clearly defined border like the changing of colors where river meets ocean or two sea currents meet each other.<br /> <br /> Anyway, elemental associations provide excuses aplenty with or without magitech i dare say.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 02-11-2023, 12:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T16:23:47-08:00","id":1504510,"title":"","content":"They could be underwater. That seems more likely than floating jade.<br /> <br /> I would think the First Age Exalted did arrange to have a god watch over those pillars. It's an important job. What happened to them after the Balorian Crusade... who knows.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</s